  + /// #1116: a Bedrock Claude id -> the anthropic preset id it is the same model
  + /// as. Bedrock spells them `[geo.]anthropic.<id>[-vN[:M]]` (`us.`, `eu.`,
  + /// `apac.`, `global.` are cross-region inference profiles; `-v1:0` is
